{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Her sickness.</b> She is ill on account of the blood." "And the meaning of <b>uncovers her spring</b> is that he committed a great abomination." "And the meaning of <b>and she has uncovered</b> is of her own will, for if she is coerced, he alone shall be cut off."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:11:22.961464662Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}